        {
          "text": "Nkaambo cakavumba nyika yoonse, aboobo nyika yakasizigwa, nkabela cakalya mani oonse aanyika amicelo yoonse yamisamu civulamabwe njicakasia. Teekwakasyaala cintu citete neciba comwe, nemuba mumisamu nemuba mumani aamusokwe, munyika yoonse yaEgepita. ",
