              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Farao wakamwaambila kuti, Zwa kulindime. Cenjela kuti utaboni busyu bwangu limbi, nkaambo mubuzuba obo mboyoobona busyu bwangu uyoofwa. ",
